+    line, keeps the LAST ``{"type":"result"}`` event (overwrite, no break), and
+    discriminates on that event's ``is_error`` + ``api_error_status`` + ``result``
+    body.  Keys ONLY on ``is_error``/``api_error_status`` — NEVER on ``subtype``
